  m_Text: 'Beat the game by finding the key and opening all 10 doors!

    Use arrow
    keys or WASD to move.

    Press R to restart the level, which will also reset
    the timer and death count to what it was when you started that level.

    Lava
    is the only thing that can kill you.

    When you respawn, you will respawn
    at the start of the level or the most recent checkpoint.

    You can try an
    easier or harder mode by going back to the main menu at any point.

    Try to
    escape with the lowest time you can get!'
